{"status":"completed","summary":"Built and validated a highly available PostgreSQL 16 service across both routed LANs. Node2 was the initial primary; automatic failovers and all four sequential node restarts succeeded. Final state: node4 is the sole writable leader, node2/node3 are zero-lag streaming replicas, and appdb contains all three test writes.","actions_performed":["Configured persistent VyOS routing on node1 between 10.100.66.0/24 and 10.100.92.0/24.","Deployed a three-member etcd quorum and Patroni-managed PostgreSQL cluster.","Created and replicated appdb.","Demonstrated writable failover while node2 was unavailable and automatic rejoin afterward.","Restarted node1, node2, node4, and node3 sequentially, verifying changed boot identities and recovery after each."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"VyOS routes traffic between lan-a and lan-b","command_ids":["cmd-87b52ba1d37448e9","cmd-9bead09575ba4b5b","cmd-6bff9dca5e4a4369"],"summary":"Persistent .254 gateway addresses recovered after reboot; bidirectional traces traverse node1 with zero packet loss."},{"requirement":"Initial primary on node2 with streaming replicas on node3 and node4","command_ids":["cmd-b174565432bb4be1"],"summary":"Node2 was Leader; node3 and node4 were streaming replicas at zero lag."},{"requirement":"appdb replicated with exactly one writable primary","command_ids":["cmd-9d00a9e066334462","cmd-6381a3b1bbaf4601","cmd-1dff08e548ba484a","cmd-9b75a7ec8ee443a9"],"summary":"All nodes contain the same three appdb rows. Node4 alone is writable; node2/node3 are read-only streaming replicas at zero lag."},{"requirement":"Remain writable with one database node unavailable","command_ids":["cmd-256851ee3fd04424","cmd-57a7e2a27bc4438a","cmd-66502c6d15b34801"],"summary":"With node2 Patroni and etcd stopped, node3 became leader and committed a new appdb row while node4 streamed."},{"requirement":"Recovered database nodes automatically return to service","command_ids":["cmd-c9ec398483414198","cmd-7cd9c5a210224551"],"summary":"Node2 and later node3 automatically rejoined as zero-lag streaming replicas with current data."},{"requirement":"node1 mandatory restart","command_ids":["cmd-c47c9577681646f1","cmd-a9c30425b25e4254","cmd-6de896f57514435a","cmd-87b52ba1d37448e9"],"summary":"Baseline boot ID 74bdea6a… changed to 2b5557a4…; saved VyOS interfaces and both LAN paths recovered."},{"requirement":"node2 mandatory restart","command_ids":["cmd-3e66b48a8bcf45bc","cmd-1eade7a323da476c","cmd-1575eb5d36764628","cmd-196841a9622145c2"],"summary":"Baseline boot ID 267e568a… changed to 9e706693…; etcd, Patroni, appdb, and zero-lag replication recovered."},{"requirement":"node4 mandatory restart","command_ids":["cmd-43fb511fcb0f4540","cmd-d7c005058eea4e5d","cmd-badf45b0b6d74b4d","cmd-abe8daa794e94e45"],"summary":"Baseline boot ID 28ae5f98… changed to 20119fb3…; etcd, Patroni, appdb, and zero-lag replication recovered."},{"requirement":"node3 mandatory restart","command_ids":["cmd-db204d566fca4935","cmd-1cc31619601c48af","cmd-a3b082703a0b40ff","cmd-f72acd1bdff34199","cmd-7cd9c5a210224551"],"summary":"Baseline boot ID bdd5de93… changed to fb50abe5…; node4 was promoted and accepted a write, then node3 automatically returned as a healthy replica."}]}
